[[2. Create Certificate Signing Request Configuration]]

<$button message="tm-modal" param="2. Create Certificate Signing Request Configuration">Modal of This</$button>

---

We will create a `csr.conf` file to have all the information to generate the CSR. Replace `demo.mlopshub.com` with your domain name or IP address.

```
cat > csr.conf <<EOF
[ req ]
default_bits = 2048
prompt = no
default_md = sha256
req_extensions = req_ext
distinguished_name = dn

[ dn ]
C = US
ST = California
L = San Fransisco
O = MLopsHub
OU = MlopsHub Dev
CN = demo.mlopshub.com

[ req_ext ]
subjectAltName = @alt_names

[ alt_names ]
DNS.1 = demo.mlopshub.com
DNS.2 = www.demo.mlopshub.com
IP.1 = 192.168.1.5
IP.2 = 192.168.1.6

EOF
```